{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0050_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0050_story_intro_title", "source_sha256": "868310e193d1af0b9a0a16b18d5826a5490fe3f9410defa30dc115829fc1db4a", "ja": "なし", "zh": "无", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0050_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0050_story_intro_synopsis", "source_sha256": "868310e193d1af0b9a0a16b18d5826a5490fe3f9410defa30dc115829fc1db4a", "ja": "なし", "zh": "无", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0050_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0050_story_intro_1000_102mis", "source_sha256": "fff8f25703696607ada9f9e7b65a78300c4d7402a907dfea60fb534151d13647", "ja": "あっ、{$P$}さん♪\n海がいいですか？　それとも、山がいいですか？", "zh": "啊，{$P$}先生♪\n你觉得去海边比较好呢？还是去山上比较好呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0050_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0050_story_intro_1001_p", "source_sha256": "bba53f8b9465c4b8cdc0f09cf23fe48271b1605a9a61a78516808c12c0d52ba6", "ja": "えっ？　ええと……。\nお疲れ様です、青羽さん。ロケの話ですか？", "zh": "什么？呃……\n辛苦你了，青羽小姐。你是在说出外景的地点吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0050_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0050_story_intro_1002_102mis", "source_sha256": "1ed824f3e7bf53a4a6ab636d95311a12514c364a06a199b358f2fb95e396f124", "ja": "ああっ、ごめんなさい！　私、ひとりで\n舞い上がっちゃって……お仕事の話じゃないんです。", "zh": "啊啊，抱歉！我自顾自地这么激动……\n我不是在讲工作的事。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0050_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0050_story_intro_1003_102mis", "source_sha256": "9fb9e6d19a64e850399b2c4267082de17d9bed7fdfdb9a83cd86a3515d4e56f5", "ja": "今度、劇場のみんなでレジャーにいく計画を\n立ててみようかな～と思って。リサーチです♪", "zh": "我想说来规划个能让剧场的伙伴们\n一起出去玩的计划，正在做意见调查♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0050_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0050_story_intro_1004_p", "source_sha256": "da924351fe110f055cd15a9bdd348ba870b7729094ca9c645552df74bb8a6592", "ja": "おっ、いいですね！\nアイドルたちの息抜きになりそうだし……。", "zh": "哦，很棒欸！\n这样应该也能让偶像们放松一下……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0050_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0050_story_intro_1005_102mis", "source_sha256": "b90bfe799d277846df414564c4c9ab5ee6d087a3bdd3792605f9affcf9464440", "ja": "ふふっ、{$P$}さんはいつでも、\nみんなが一番！なんですね♪", "zh": "呵呵，{$P$}先生你总是\n把大家放在第一顺位来思考呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0050_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0050_story_intro_1006_p", "source_sha256": "3485239ed7c1f9db0a244df01b58d8cff316aa7613b6d46049702dec203e5c43", "ja": "まあ、それが仕事ですからね。…って、仕事といえば。\nまた社長に呼ばれてるので、留守をお願いできますか？", "zh": "哎，毕竟这是我的工作啊……啊，说到工作，\n社长有事找我，可以麻烦你顾一下这里吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0050_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0050_story_intro_1007_102mis", "source_sha256": "a7da207907709bd834c00f2e1cb5f1f3707733330c6d985f6ff101f9177669e7", "ja": "あっ、はーい！　なんのお話か、楽しみですね♪\nいってらっしゃ～い♪", "zh": "啊，好的～！真期待社长要跟你谈什么呢♪\n慢走喔～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0050_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0050_story_intro_1008_null", "source_sha256": "efc1d82f27c00c2cd66242ba3968b75b5084f0ad635f478df59f2ea4ca40369e", "ja": "そして……", "zh": "然后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0050_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0050_story_intro_1009_p", "source_sha256": "08516f10ff87b221d0bb7baa49ce5d32f106e241096ad7d20a9d544168bc22e3", "ja": "ふぅ……失礼します。\n社長、お待たせしました。", "zh": "呼……打扰了。\n社长，让你久等了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0050_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0050_story_intro_1010_president", "source_sha256": "d298ae722699d4311043c41f77ea64b00227bb8b6933a489d4ab5bb7f72ede90", "ja": "おおっ、君！　よく来てくれたね。\nまあ、かけてくれたまえ！", "zh": "哦哦，你来得正好！\n哎，你先坐下吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0050_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0050_story_intro_1011_101kot", "source_sha256": "23d9edb5d0fc9a41f27956d85f85d2960f23660f948781c6a7ea49adef2f9791", "ja": "お疲れさまです、{$P$}さん。\n暑くて大変でしたよね？　はい、うちわをどうぞ♪", "zh": "辛苦了，{$P$}先生。\n外面很热吧？来，扇子给你♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0050_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0050_story_intro_1012_p", "source_sha256": "ad0e43fd142e1ca7cf6f785e92b8cf40f294f0bbbcd4f9e3bff83a0b50f37fc1", "ja": "ありがとうございます、音無さん。\n（パタパタパタ）あぁ……生き返ります！", "zh": "谢谢你，音无小姐。\n（搧扇子）呼……总算凉一点了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0050_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0050_story_intro_1013_president", "source_sha256": "b772fda9b67261dd71fd5887762318b97627f2ac8828fa68b35ee17868e8bbd2", "ja": "いやあ、夏真っ盛りといったところだね！\nところで、夏といえば……そう、海だ！", "zh": "哎呀，现在正是夏天最热的时期啊！\n对了，说到夏天……没错，就是大海！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0050_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0050_story_intro_1014_president", "source_sha256": "8806faa7f47e1d2bd0ff43736877b24930e99bc3446d8d4f34af922d0c59e8e3", "ja": "私も今年は南の島にでも行って、こんがり肌を焼いて\nみようと思っている。まだまだ若い者には負けんよ！", "zh": "今年我也想要去个南国小岛，把皮肤晒得黝黑一点。\n我可还不会输给年轻人啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0050_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0050_story_intro_1015_101kot", "source_sha256": "21dd8677e291da739b48f50092d07e246c1cbc3f350916ae8533b0bf9a179671", "ja": "もう、社長ったら。\nそれ以上、黒くなってどうするつもりですか？", "zh": "社长你真是的，\n你竟然还想晒得比现在更黑吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0050_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0050_story_intro_1016_president", "source_sha256": "2b3a9fed50b82a8a99042e2e8c968d2b149f15198906da7752d76e7a7f913fc4", "ja": "ふふふ、社長たる者、常に限界に挑戦しなくてはね！\nそう、黒さでも、そして仕事でも！", "zh": "呵呵呵，身为一个社长，当然随时要挑战极限啊！\n没错，不管是皮肤黑的程度，还是在工作方面！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0050_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0050_story_intro_1017_p", "source_sha256": "6b8ee697a145aadaa7a7cddb94c5aa5ae3dd2043337d5851aca9b25089bbf8d2", "ja": "おお……！\n仕事の話だったんですね？", "zh": "哦哦……！\n社长刚才说的那些是有关工作的吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0050_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0050_story_intro_1018_president", "source_sha256": "aff2a6c19e27e6aaee7742be1cd7441c30635050c80c922bcb818ce110b19927", "ja": "当然だよ君！　君のことだから、\nもう察しがついてるかもしれないが……。", "zh": "那当然啊！你这么聪明，\n可能已经察觉到我要说什么了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0050_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0050_story_intro_1019_president", "source_sha256": "5dedb33316259ce29e1ccdf58e64f2cec4a543010efcaad42fb2284a37af41a4", "ja": "先日アイドル諸君に受けてもらった\nオーディションの結果が、ついに出たのだ！", "zh": "前阵子请诸位偶像参加的试镜，\n结果终于出来了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0050_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0050_story_intro_1020_101kot", "source_sha256": "7a87948862dd93795095d6bce79b95d00afee8ebfe3d126719c1455bd216f278", "ja": "あっ、あの『水着アイドル我慢大会』の結果が？", "zh": "啊，是那个『泳装偶像忍耐大赛』的结果吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0050_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0050_story_intro_1021_president", "source_sha256": "37dd68a062c4ba054691b278da9cb3f46b6959ef962aefdf2e17d6ba5cd0f948", "ja": "いや、そっちじゃない。\nあの、超青春・超スポ根・超大作映画！", "zh": "不对，不是那个。\n是那部超级青春、超级热血运动风、超级强档电影！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0050_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0050_story_intro_1022_president", "source_sha256": "a2a76f0ab35983167f0a30b2930517c4cc86c9fe54227d4e7d6a6a5daa50db1b", "ja": "『超ビーチバレー』をテーマとした映画のことだ！\n見事合格だよ、君！", "zh": "就是那部主题是『超级沙滩排球』的电影啊！\n我跟你说，我们的偶像顺利录取了喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0050_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0050_story_intro_1023_p", "source_sha256": "4f3f159323389af4205b6d117c95cd318ea6173e49a72a06a63814c2a5c1cfa3", "ja": "おおっ、決まったんですね！？\nよかった……！", "zh": "哦哦，定案了吗！？\n太好了……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0050_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0050_story_intro_1024_president", "source_sha256": "e20f8b716b7be387490156de22332eb14b553a746c6fe8bf5e2d170d9e016b6d", "ja": "うむ、これもアイドル諸君の健闘と、君のプロデュース\n活動のたまものだ。よくやってくれた！", "zh": "嗯，能有这样的结果，都多亏了偶像们的奋斗，\n以及你的培育。你们做得很好！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0050_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0050_story_intro_1025_101kot", "source_sha256": "2cc0d4dc856df38cd2d14a9dd3bccd5f945ee616b80a0709b1ce327810a9dd4d", "ja": "おめでとうございます♪\nどんな映画になるのか、今から楽しみですね！", "zh": "恭喜♪\n我已经开始期待会拍出怎么样的电影了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0050_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0050_story_intro_1026_president", "source_sha256": "dd08262642280fd7f60b1531b932cd4fe200a128c583f07205563a98ef5385d9", "ja": "君の熱心なプッシュで勝ち取った役だ。\n感動もひとしおだろう……。", "zh": "这是在你积极争取下所赢得的工作，\n你想必也格外感动吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0050_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0050_story_intro_1027_president", "source_sha256": "eebaff7d6b3ac3425ef538b7d81269100d9357eb12556d9628d7ff627631b648", "ja": "その熱い情熱のほとばしるままに、\n存分に腕をふるってくれたまえ！", "zh": "就尽情燃烧这份炽热的热情，\n充分发挥你的能力吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0050_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0050_story_intro_1028", "source_sha256": "8d9bcf80d70321a6fa9609edc2116741a7ccd3e65040723f64234cb586d4ad65", "ja": "ふるいます！", "zh": "我会努力的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0050_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0050_story_intro_2000_p", "source_sha256": "c80706ea2a2b6ddd4af8a429a4e0a536e623a6a85c5dda2d7b989d4ed0a6dd60", "ja": "はい、任せてください。超ビーチバレーのテーマに\nふさわしく、超ふるってみせます！", "zh": "好的，请交给我吧。我会使出全力超级奋斗，\n绝对不会愧对「超级沙滩排球」这个主题！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0050_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0050_story_intro_2001_president", "source_sha256": "f1bf0b17699a4ae1dc8a745154a445c615c33606278093bce43723a6633b45bd", "ja": "はっはっは、その意気だ！\n私も、超期待しているよ～！", "zh": "哈哈哈，就是要有这份决心！\n我也超级期待的喔～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0050_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0050_story_intro_2002_101kot", "source_sha256": "15bfa728826652d56c612adac3e4f645685dc4de8007b37d9fd407ab873b1d21", "ja": "私も超楽しみです♪\nなんちゃって！", "zh": "我也是，超级期待成果的♪\n乱讲的啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
